# Route: guide 10 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 30 to
# 31, 33 quests, 3.2 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stonetalon Mountains): Sun Rock Retreat -> Malaka'jin -> Grimtotem
# Post -> Camp Aparaje -> Sishir Canyon -> Webwinder Path -> Malaka'jin -> Sun
# Rock Retreat -> The Charred Vale -> Sun Rock Retreat -> Webwinder Path ->
# Windshear Crag -> Webwinder Path -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Arachnophobia (6284; Besseleth
# 21); Bloodfury Bloodline (6283; Bloodfury Ripper 26).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category).

